+The landing page (`SiteWorker`, ADR 0020) uses the stage's own name without `app` or `submit`: `pr-<n>.surveybeat.app` and `staging.surveybeat.app`. `production` serves it on workers.dev until the apex cutover below, and every other stage stays on workers.dev.
